rooms_desc ({"THERE IS A 52\" COLOR TV WITH SURROUND SOUND ON ONE WALL.  ACROSS THE ROOM THERE IS A COUCH, ABOVE WHICH THERE IS A LARGE PAINTING OF MY GIRLFRIEND.  PAINTEDBY E. ST PETER.  ON THE LEFT SIDE OF THE COUCH THERE IS A TABLE WITH A LAMP.ON THE OTHER SIDE IS A LAZY-BOY LOUNGER.  A LARGE POTTED PLANT HANGS ABOVETHE LAZY-BOY**"," THIS IS THE MASTER BEDROOM.  IN THE CENTER OF THE ROOM LIES A FULL KINGSIZED BED.  AT THE FOOT OF THE BED IS A SMALL ANTIQUE STAND ON WHICH A T.V.RESTS.  ON THE FAR SIDE OF THE ROOM IS MY FIANCEE'S DRESSER.  ON TOP OF THE DRESSER STANDS AN ELEGANT MIRROR.  ON THE NEAR SIDE OF THE BED IS MY PERSONALNIGHTSTAND.","THIS IS A SMALL BATHROOM WHICH HAS TWO SINKS SIDE BY SIDE ON THE LEFT.  INTHE FAR LEFT CORNER IS THE TOILET.  ON THE RIGHT A SHOWER.***","THIS IS THE KITCHEN.  IT HAS A STOVE ON THE RIGHT, AND ON THE LEFT THEREIS A MATCHING REFRIDGERATOR/FREEZER(WITH ICE MAKER).  STRIGHT AHEADTHERE IS A MICROWVAE WHICH SITS UPON AN OLD CHINA CABINET.  INSIDETHE CABINET THERE ARE SEVERAL ANTIQUES WHICH HAVE BEEN PASSED ON THROUGHMANY GENERATIONS.  IN THE CENTER OF THE ROOM STANDS A SAMLL TABLETHIS TABLE IS MAINLY FOR EATING BREAKFAST AND LUNCH. THE DINING ROOMIS TO THE EAST.","IN THE CENTER OF THE ROOM THERE IS A LARGE ANTIQUE WOODEN TABLE.THERE IS A SMALL BUT NICE LOOKING CHANDILIER ABOVE THE TABLE. THIS ISTHE ROOM IN WHICH THE FAMILY EATS DINNER EVERY NIGHT.",0,0,0,0,0,})
